  "fullDescription": "Home decor enthusiasts and fans of earthy botanical art will appreciate this rich, warm design. A deep burgundy-brown fig is sliced open to reveal a soft peach interior with a radiating seed pattern, with a green leaf and stem attached at the top, all set against a warm cream background in a simple vertical print format. The style is clean and editorial, inspired by vintage botanical illustration. It works well as wall art, on tote bags, linen goods, kitchen items, and nature-themed apparel. Perfect for cottagecore lovers, kitchen decor, and earthy aesthetic gifts.\n\nWhat’s Included\n– SVG file – fully scalable, ideal for cutting machines and design software\n– PNG file – high-resolution with transparent background, ready for sublimation and printing\n\nHow It Works\nThis is an instant digital download. Once your purchase is complete, your files are available immediately — no waiting, no shipping. Just download, open, and create!\n\nImportant Notes\n– Digital file only — no physical item will be mailed\n– SVG files work with Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Studio, Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, and similar programs\n– PNG files can be used in most graphic design and sublimation software\n– Colors may vary slightly depending on your screen and printer setup",
